#: auth.py:1288
msgid "Password set."
msgstr "Wachtwoord ingesteld."

#. Context: Settings › Change password › error
#: auth.py:1474
msgid "Current password is incorrect."
msgstr "Het huidige wachtwoord is onjuist."

#. Context: Settings › confirmation
